  <!-- In-Depth Clinical Guide: Gum Treatment in Hennur -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-24 bg-japandi-sand/25 border-y border-japandi-clay/30">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium tracking-tight">
          Understanding Gum Disease &amp; Pyorrhea in Hennur
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Gums and surrounding bone form the foundation that keeps your natural teeth anchored in your jaw. When bacterial plaque and mineralized tartar (calculus) accumulate along and below the gum margin, bacteria trigger chronic inflammation.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          In its early stage, known as <strong>gingivitis</strong>, gums become swollen, tender, and bleed easily during brushing. If left untreated, bacteria migrate deep beneath the gum line, forming infected pockets. This progressive condition, commonly called <strong>pyorrhea</strong> or <strong>periodontitis</strong>, gradually erodes the underlying alveolar bone and connective fibers, causing teeth to become loose and eventually leading to tooth loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Clinical Interventions -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Comprehensive Gum Treatment Modalities at Aureva Dental Hennur
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          We combine gentle clinical care with modern technology to stop active gum infection and restore periodontal health:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Digital RVG Radiographic Diagnosis</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Every gum assessment begins with high-resolution digital RVG radiography. This allows our clinicians to clearly evaluate alveolar bone levels around each tooth, locate hidden tartar deposits below the gum line, and establish an accurate treatment baseline.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Deep Periodontal Scaling &amp; Root Planing</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              For patients with periodontal pockets exceeding 4 mm, routine cleaning is insufficient. Deep scaling meticulously removes bacterial calculus and toxins embedded deep beneath the gum line. Root planing then smooths rough root surfaces, discouraging future bacterial colonization and allowing gum tissue to reattach firmly to the tooth.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Laser Gum Treatment</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We employ dental laser technology for precise, comfortable decontamination of infected gum pockets. The laser energy vaporizes harmful anaerobic bacteria and selectively removes diseased tissue lining without incisions or sutures, resulting in faster healing and minimal discomfort.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Periodontist On Call for Advanced Cases</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              For complex cases involving severe bone loss, deep infrabony defects, or gum recession, our clinic collaborates with experienced visiting periodontists (gum specialists) on call to deliver targeted regenerative and surgical care.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Transparent Gum Treatment Cost in Hennur Table Section -->
      <div id="pricing" class="space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-japandi-clay/30">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-japandi-moss">Transparent Pricing</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
            Gum Treatment Cost in Hennur
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
            Straightforward pricing with complete clarity before beginning any procedure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-japandi-clay/40 bg-japandi-sand/30">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
