          We are open Tuesday through Sunday (9:30 AM to 9:00 PM) and Monday (4:00 PM to 9:00 PM), with open slots on Sundays for convenient family visits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Internal Links to Related Treatment & Local Pages -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-sand/50 border border-japandi-clay/50 space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Explore Related Specialty Treatments &amp; Local Care Guides:
        </h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-japandi-moss font-medium">
