        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Frequently Asked Questions About Gum Treatment in Hennur
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Clear, medically accurate answers to help you understand your periodontal health and care plan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
